atile</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" title=\"Dippable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.35 kg (2.7 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.35 kg (2.7 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 640 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  640  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2eeabe97-8f29-4f4f-827e-6cfcd8fd1779</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2eeabe97-8f29-4f4f-827e-6cfcd8fd1779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2eeabe97-8f29-4f4f-827e-6cfcd8fd1779\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_SHA_SeluneBlessing_Spear+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/60px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/80px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 3 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonmote\" title=\"Moonmote\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/40px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/60px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/80px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonmote\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/40px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonmote\" title=\"Moonmote\">Moonmote</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Illuminate the area around you with wisps of moonish light that make movement difficult for enemies and bolster your allies' damage. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Blessing_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Selûne's Blessing (passive feature)\">Selûne's Blessing</a></dt><dd>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> Checks.</dd></dl><dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/60px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/80px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a></span></dt><dd>Can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft).</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rush Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\">Rush Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward and attack the first enemy in your way, possibly pushing them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off Balance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\">Off Balance</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maiming_Strike\" title=\"Maiming Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Maiming Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Crippling_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Maiming_Strike\" title=\"Maiming Strike\">Maiming Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maimed_(Condition)\" title=\"Maimed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Maims\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Maimed_(Condition)\" title=\"Maimed (Condition)\">Maims</a> your target. They can't move. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/38px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/50px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aylin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\">Aylin</a> at the  <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite#Act_Two\" title=\"Campsite\">campsite</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Steps for acquisition:\n<ul><li>Shadowheart must be present in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfell\" title=\"Shadowfell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowfell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfell\" title=\"Shadowfell\">Shadowfell</a>; she leaves the party upon returning from the Shadowfell if they enter without her and becomes hostile if the party insist on entering the Shadowfell without the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Spear of Night\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Spear_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Spear of Night\">Spear of Night</a> in the inventory of the active party.</li>\n<li>Aylin must survive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chosen_of_Shar\" title=\"The Chosen of Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Chosen of Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Chosen_of_Shar\" title=\"The Chosen of Shar\">The Chosen of Shar</a>.</li>\n<li>The player character must speak with Aylin in camp after <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric</a> is defeated.</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Darkvision:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The actual distance of Darkvision often depends on the creature that has this feature. The values above are the default for playable races.</li>\n<li>When a <a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hiding</a> creature enters the line of sight of a creature with darkvision, and is within the range of darkvision:\n<ul><li>Being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly Obscured</a> counts as being under <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clear Area\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\">Clear Area</a> instead.</li>\n<li>Being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a> counts as being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly Obscured</a> instead.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The same applies to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Darkvision\" title=\"Superior Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/30px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Superior Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Darkvision\" title=\"Superior Darkvision\">Superior Darkvision</a>, just with a longer range.</li>\n<li>Also granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\">Sarevok's Horned Helmet</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift\" title=\"Sunwalker's Gift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Ring_H_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift\" title=\"Sunwalker's Gift\">Sunwalker's Gift</a>.</li>\n<li>More information on Darkvision mechanics and its potential combat implications can be found <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_Mechanics\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Darkvision Mechanics\">here</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Darkvision:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Normally, a creature gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> when making a ranged attack from within magical <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/30px-Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/40px-Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a>, assuming it can do so via a feature such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/30px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/40px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devil's Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\">Devil's Sight</a> that grants vision in magical darkness. However, if the target of the attack has Darkvision, and the attacker is within the target's Darkvision range, then the attacker gains no advantage. This is despite the fact that Darkvision does not grant vision in magical darkness.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.171 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.185 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7077/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 120743/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 29773/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function co